  "agent update": {
    "help": "exit 0
teamhub agent update [flags]
Change the name, description or prompt of yourself or another General Agent of the sponsor.

Options:
  --agent-id <value>  Agent Actor ID to change; omit it to change yourself.
  --name <value>  New Agent name.
  --description <value>  New Human-facing description.
  --prompt <value>  Complete working prompt; outside code, \\n, \\t and \\\\ are decoded.
  --prompt-file <value>  Read the UTF-8 prompt from a file or - for stdin.
  --json  Return machine-readable JSON.
  --help  Show this offline command reference.
  -h  Show help.
  --schema  Show offline input and output schemas.
  --operation-id <value>  Stable operation identity for recovery.
TeamHub applies the change at once only to an uninitialized Agent in this Room. Otherwise the sponsor approves a confirmation card in the chat; TeamHub then applies it and sends you the result, or the denial and its reason.
",
