  "apps search": {
    "help": "exit 0
teamhub apps search [flags]
Discover versioned tools for one concrete app action.

Arguments:
  <query>

Options:
  --connectionId <value>  Exact delegated connection ID.
  --name <value>  Exact application name, for example notion.
  --limit <value>  Maximum tools; 1-50, default 20.
  --json  Return machine-readable JSON.
  --help  Show this offline command reference.
  -h  Show help.
  --schema  Show offline input and output schemas.
