  "docs create": {
    "help": "exit 0
teamhub docs create --title <text> (--content <text> | --file <path|->) [flags]
Create a Native Document in the configured Room or Task.

Options:
  --title <value>  Required Document title, 1-255 characters.
  --content <value>  Inline Markdown body; outside code, \\n, \\t and \\\\ are decoded. Exclusive with --file, which is never decoded.
  --file <value>  Read the UTF-8 body from a regular file or - for stdin.
  --json  Return machine-readable JSON.
  --help  Show this offline command reference.
  -h  Show help.
  --schema  Show offline input and output schemas.
  --operation-id <value>  Stable operation identity for recovery.
Examples:
teamhub docs create --title "Research report" --file ./report.md
",
