  "docs get": {
    "help": "exit 0
teamhub docs get <name-or-id-or-link> [flags]
Download an authorized Document working copy or export.

Arguments:
  <name-or-id-or-link>  Exact name, Document ID or supported share link.

Options:
  -o <value>  Output path; exclusive with --output.
  --output <value>  Output path relative to cwd.
  --format <value>  markdown, blocks or html.
  --raw  Keep original bytes without extracting embedded images.
