  "figma comment": {
    "help": "exit 0
Post a comment on a design file or reply to a root comment.

USAGE
  teamhub figma comment <file-key|url> (--content <text> | --file <path|->) [--reply <id>] [flags]
  teamhub figma comment --schema [--json]

FLAGS
  --content <value>             Comment body; exclusive with --file.
  --file <value>                UTF-8 body file; - reads stdin.
  --reply <value>               Root comment ID to reply to.
  --account <value>             Select a connection ID or complete account label; when authorization is missing, an authorization card is shown in the chat.
  --json                        Print complete JSON instead of the default readable text.
  --schema                      Show offline input and output schemas without business arguments.
  --operation-id <value>        Stable identity for this operation; keep it when the outcome is unknown and do not blindly resend.

INHERITED FLAGS
  -h, --help                   Show help.

OUTPUT
  Shows the actual account, plus The published comment ID and reply target when present.

Figma Design only; FigJam, Slides, whole-file export, and PDF merge are out of scope.
Help and schema are available offline; TeamHub checks current access at execution time.

EXAMPLES
  teamhub figma comment FILE_KEY --content 'Please unify this spacing to 16.'

LEARN MORE
  teamhub figma --help
  teamhub figma comment --schema --json
",
