  "figma export": {
    "help": "exit 0
Export selected nodes locally; supports node URLs and explicit multi-select.

USAGE
  teamhub figma export <file-key|url> [--node <id>] --format <png|jpg|svg|pdf> --output <path> [flags]
  teamhub figma export --schema [--json]

FLAGS
  --node <value>                Node ID to export; repeatable; a node URL may omit this.
  --format <value>              png / jpg / svg / pdf; required.
  --output <value>              Save one node as a new file; save multiple nodes into a new directory.
  --scale <value>               png/jpg scale 0.01–4; default 1.
  --account <value>             Select a connection ID or complete account label; when authorization is missing, an authorization card is shown in the chat.
  --json                        Print complete JSON instead of the default readable text.
  --schema                      Show offline input and output schemas without business arguments.

INHERITED FLAGS
  -h, --help                   Show help.

OUTPUT
  Shows the actual account, plus Saved path, format, byte size, and SHA-256 for each node.

Figma Design only; FigJam, Slides, whole-file export, and PDF merge are out of scope.
Help and schema are available offline; TeamHub checks current access at execution time.

EXAMPLES
  teamhub figma export 'https://www.figma.com/design/FILE_KEY/Design?node-id=1-2' --format png --scale 2 --output ./screen.png
  teamhub figma export FILE_KEY --node 1:2 --node 1:3 --format pdf --output ./selected-pages

LEARN MORE
  teamhub figma --help
  teamhub figma export --schema --json
",
