  "gcal free": {
    "help": "exit 0
Find shared free time across calendars; query only, does not book.

USAGE
  teamhub gcal free --from <RFC3339> --to <RFC3339> [--with <email>] [--calendar <id>] [flags]
  teamhub gcal free --schema [--json]

FLAGS
  --from <value>                RFC3339 start of the time window.
  --to <value>                  RFC3339 end of the time window; at most 31 days.
  --with <value>                Email of the other person's primary calendar; repeatable.
  --calendar <value>            Calendar ID; repeatable; includes primary when omitted.
  --duration <value>            Minimum consecutive free minutes, 1–1440; default 30.
  --account <value>             Select a connection ID or complete account label; when authorization is missing, an authorization card is shown in the chat.
  --json                        Print complete JSON instead of the default readable text.
  --schema                      Show offline input and output schemas without business arguments.

INHERITED FLAGS
  -h, --help                   Show help.

OUTPUT
  Shows the actual account, plus Time ranges that are free on every selected calendar; does not create events.

Help and schema are available offline; TeamHub checks current access at execution time.

EXAMPLES
  teamhub gcal free --from 2026-10-19T09:00:00-04:00 --to 2026-10-19T18:00:00-04:00 --with alice@example.invalid

LEARN MORE
  teamhub gcal --help
  teamhub gcal free --schema --json
",
