  "gdrive download": {
    "help": "exit 0
Download a file or explicitly export a supported format without overwriting local files.

USAGE
  teamhub gdrive download <file-id> --output <path> [--format <format>] [flags]
  teamhub gdrive download --schema [--json]

FLAGS
  --output <value>              Local file path; does not overwrite.
  --format <value>              Native Workspace documents require pdf/docx/xlsx/pptx/csv/txt.
  --account <value>             Select a connection ID or complete account label; when authorization is missing, an authorization card is shown in the chat.
  --json                        Print complete JSON instead of the default readable text.
  --schema                      Show offline input and output schemas without business arguments.

INHERITED FLAGS
  -h, --help                   Show help.

OUTPUT
  Shows the actual account, plus Absolute path, actual byte size, and SHA-256 of the saved file.

Help and schema are available offline; TeamHub checks current access at execution time.

EXAMPLES
  teamhub gdrive download file_example --output ./proposal.pdf

LEARN MORE
  teamhub gdrive --help
  teamhub gdrive download --schema --json
",
