  "gmail list": {
    "help": "exit 0
List the inbox or search messages.

USAGE
  teamhub gmail list [flags]
  teamhub gmail list --schema [--json]

FLAGS
  --limit <value>               1–100 items per page; default 20.
  --cursor <value>              Cursor returned by the previous page; keep the same account and filters.
  --folder <value>              inbox / sent / all; default inbox.
  --query <value>               Search text; Gmail accepts native query syntax.
  --unread                      List unread messages only.
  --account <value>             Select a connection ID or complete account label; when authorization is missing, an authorization card is shown in the chat.
  --json                        Print complete JSON instead of the default readable text.
  --schema                      Show offline input and output schemas without business arguments.

INHERITED FLAGS
  -h, --help                   Show help.

OUTPUT
  Shows the actual account, plus Message IDs, subjects, senders, unread state, and next-page cursor.

Help and schema are available offline; TeamHub checks current access at execution time.

EXAMPLES
  teamhub gmail list --unread
  teamhub gmail list --query 'from:alice@example.invalid' --json

LEARN MORE
  teamhub gmail --help
  teamhub gmail list --schema --json
",
