  "knowledge read": {
    "help": "exit 0
teamhub knowledge read [flags]
Read exact authorized evidence sections.

Arguments:
  <evidence-id>

Options:
  --section-id <value>  Exact sectionId from this source; 1-8 unique values.
  --offset <value>  Continue one section at this exact offset; 0-200000.
  --json  Return machine-readable JSON.
  --help  Show this offline command reference.
  -h  Show help.
  --schema  Show offline input and output schemas.
",
