  "message emoji": {
    "help": "exit 0
teamhub message emoji <message-id> <emoji>
React to a visible message with one emoji.

Arguments:
  <message-id>  Message in a Room or Thread you belong to.
  <emoji>  Emoji ID from the official Reaction library, e.g. joy, ok_hand, +1, heart, tada.

Options:
  --json  Return machine-readable JSON.
  --help  Show this offline command reference.
  -h  Show help.
  --schema  Show offline input and output schemas.
  --operation-id <value>  Stable operation identity for recovery.
A Reaction is not a message: it never notifies or wakes anyone.
Repeating the same emoji on the same message changes nothing.
",
