  "message read": {
    "help": "exit 0
teamhub message read [--thread <id>] [flags]
teamhub message read --message-ids <id1,id2,...>
teamhub message read --inbox <inbox-id>
teamhub message read --list-inboxes
Read an authorized conversation or a batch of complete messages.

Options:
  --thread <value>  Bare Thread ID inside the configured Room.
  --message-ids <value>  1-50 comma-separated unique message IDs, returned in input order.
  --inbox <value>  Explicit authorized room:, thread:, task:, private meta: or taskmeta: Inbox address.
  --list-inboxes  Discover all authorized Inboxes without default filtering.
  --cursor <value>  Exact previous next_cursor.
  --limit <value>  Page size from 1 to 100; default 20.
  --json  Return machine-readable JSON.
  --help  Show this offline command reference.
  -h  Show help.
  --schema  Show offline input and output schemas.
