  "message search": {
    "help": "exit 0
teamhub message search <query> [--inbox <inbox-id> ...] [flags]
Search authorized message history, optionally within explicit Inboxes.

Arguments:
  <query>  Nonblank case-insensitive substring; preserved literally. Matches message text only, not author names.

Options:
  --inbox <value>  Explicit authorized Inbox filter; repeat up to 100 times.
  --cursor <value>  Exact previous next_cursor.
  --limit <value>  Page size from 1 to 100; default 20.
  --json  Return machine-readable JSON.
  --help  Show this offline command reference.
  -h  Show help.
  --schema  Show offline input and output schemas.
",
