teamhub room create [flags]
Request Human approval for a Room and its first message.

Options:
  --name <value>  Proposed Room name.
  --description <value>  Optional description.
  --member-id <value>  Explicit member Actor ID; repeat for each member.
  --member-ids <value>  Explicit member Actor ID array as JSON.
  --content <value>  Inline Markdown body; outside code, \\n, \\t and \\\\ are decoded.
  --file <value>  Read UTF-8 body from a file or - for stdin.
  --initial-message-segments <value>  Initial text/reference segments as a JSON array.
  --initial-message-segments-file <value>  Read initial-message-segments JSON from a file or - for stdin.
  --artifact-id <value>  Authorized existing Document ID; repeat up to five times.
  --artifacts <value>  Authorized Document IDs as a JSON array.
  --json  Return machine-readable JSON.
  --help  Show this offline command reference.
  -h  Show help.
  --schema  Show offline input and output schemas.
  --operation-id <value>  Stable operation identity for recovery.
",
