  "slack channels": {
    "help": "exit 0
List visible channels; does not join automatically.

USAGE
  teamhub slack channels [flags]
  teamhub slack channels --schema [--json]

FLAGS
  --limit <value>               1–100 items per page; default 20.
  --cursor <value>              Cursor from the previous page; keep the same account and query.
  --account <value>             Select a connection ID or complete account label; when authorization is missing, an authorization card is shown in the chat.
  --json                        Print complete JSON instead of the default readable text.
  --schema                      Show offline input and output schemas without business arguments.

INHERITED FLAGS
  -h, --help                   Show help.

OUTPUT
  Shows the actual account, plus Channel names, IDs, types, and next-page cursor.

Help and schema are available offline; TeamHub checks current access at execution time.

EXAMPLES
  teamhub slack channels --limit 50

LEARN MORE
  teamhub slack --help
  teamhub slack channels --schema --json
",
    "schema": "exit 0
