teamhub task create [flags]
Delegate a Task to your own AlterEgo; it starts at once, no approval is requested.

Options:
  --name <value>  Short Task title, 1-120 characters.
  --requirement <value>  Self-contained plain-text brief: the work, the Room context it needs, Document IDs or file paths, the completion standard and what to report.
  --requirement-file <value>  Read the requirement from a UTF-8 file, or - for stdin.
  --json  Return machine-readable JSON.
  --help  Show this offline command reference.
  -h  Show help.
  --schema  Show offline input and output schemas.
  --operation-id <value>  Stable operation identity for recovery.
",
